\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]sessions, and the \"daily review\" theme step are gone from Rust, the[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian mirror, docs, and memory.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]task_root_fields.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/task_root_fields.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-e2[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-e2/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust root field contract and attribution[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-field[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-field: add the \\[root:: NOTE] parser, per-block root facts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as-if-residence home resolution, task-metric and theme-default support, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]health lints, shared vectors, and the R11 contract, all additive.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian root mark[/bold #D7AFFF]                                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-mark[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-mark: render each root field as a hue-dot place mark in Live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Preview, Reading view, and Tasks/Dataview rows in bob-ledger-tools, with[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compact, rolls-up, and repair states, a toggle, tests, docs, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault template and ^gtd backfill[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-backfill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-backfill: add \\[root:: gtd_daily] to the daily template and, per [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the backfill decision, every existing ^gtd line; optionally add theme [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PLAN to gtd_daily.md; commit under the sync lock and verify.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire review buckets in Rust, docs, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire-review[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-field, vault-backfill[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire-review: delete @daily, @review buckets, review sessions, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]review metric filter, and the daily-review theme step; redefine [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]review_time; update vectors, fixtures, docs, and the memory decisions; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ship as a breaking JSON change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian homes mirror and Stats cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-mirror[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-mark, retire-review[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-mirror: bring the JS homes mirror and theme suggester to the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract, drop @daily, @review, and short_label handling from Stats and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the Day strip, sync shared vectors, add root-mark parity, and deploy.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-e2","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-e2.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b8fd4c08c64180ab3fc3c57c51d1097a","started_at":"2026-10-29T02:30:36.174047+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-e2","bbugyi200.athena.